msgid "AI Assistant"
msgstr "Assistente de IA"

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:81
#: templates/admin/translations.php:1183
msgid ""
"AI features are only available in the Elite Bundle during beta. Click to "
"learn more."
msgstr ""
"As funcionalidades de IA estão disponíveis apenas no Pacote Elite durante a "
"versão beta. Clique para saber mais."

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:85
#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:89
#: templates/admin/translations.php:442
msgid "Import with AI"
msgstr "Importar com IA"

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:86
msgid ""
"Paste in recipe text and let AI turn it into a new recipe you can review and "
"save in the recipe modal."
msgstr ""
"Cole o texto da receita e deixe que a IA o transforme numa nova receita que "
"pode rever e guardar na janela da receita."

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:96
#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:100
#: templates/admin/translations.php:826
msgid "Suggest Tags"
msgstr "Sugerir tags"

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:97
msgid ""
"Use AI to suggest recipe tags and taxonomy terms based on the recipe content."
msgstr ""
"Utilize a IA para sugerir etiquetas de receitas e termos de taxonomia com "
"base no conteúdo da receita."

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:107
#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:111
msgid "Generate Ideas"
msgstr "Gerar ideias"

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:108
msgid ""
"Generate new ideas for recipes, roundups, and other content you can use as "
"inspiration for future posts."
msgstr ""
"Gere novas ideias para receitas, resumos e outros conteúdos que pode usar "
"como inspiração para futuros artigos."

