#: templates/settings/group-template-editor.php:23
msgid "Template Editor"
msgstr "Editor de modelos"

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:119
msgid ""
"Use AI inside the Template Editor to suggest recipe card HTML and CSS "
"changes you can review before saving."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:122
msgid "Open Template Editor"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:129
#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:133
msgid "Nutrition Review"
msgstr "Revisão nutricional"

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:130
msgid ""
"Review ingredient matches and units with AI, let Spoonacular calculate the "
"nutrition facts, and queue recipes that still need manual review."
msgstr ""
"Reveja as combinações e unidades de ingredientes com IA, deixe Spoonacular "
"calcular os dados nutricionais e enfileirar receitas que ainda precisam de "
"revisão manual."

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:140
#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:144
msgid "Unit Conversion Review"
msgstr "Revisão de conversão de unidades"

#: includes/admin/class-wprm-ai-assistant.php:141
msgid ""
"Review direct-rule and AI-assisted converted ingredient units in batches, "
"then apply the confirmed second unit system to recipes that are ready."
msgstr ""
"Reveja as unidades de ingredientes convertidos por regra direta e assistidas "
"por IA em lotes e, em seguida, aplique o sistema de segunda unidade "
"confirmado às receitas que estão prontas."

